Come and help us look after Meadowbrook. We hold regular community workdays where volunteers help with practical tasks around the site - from tidying and painting to gardening and general maintenance.

Some Tools Provides. Bring gloves, Loppers and Secateurs if you can. No experience needed, just a willingness to get stuck in.

## Tasks for the day

- Finishing painting the front of the building
- Painting the masonry on the Pizza Logica side
- Cleaning the metal fire escape
- Clearing the vegetation growing up the pool fence (firefighters are coming to drain the pool, and we may have spectators)
- Clearing vegetation on the path along the playing field (you currently have to limbo)
- Carpentry maintenance on the wooden fire escape (we need a carpenter for this)
- Filling divots

[Subscribe to updates](/subscribe-to-updates) to be notified of any changes.
